        "number": "2",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "EST 2"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "2",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Esiteri okoba eting’ana",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 2:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nyuma y’amang’ana ayio, ekero endamwamu y’omorwoti Ahaswero yakendire, akaba okoinyora igoro ya Vasti, buna akorete, naende buna ogochika kwaruetwe igoro yaye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.2.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.2.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 2:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio abasomba abarenge gokorera omorwoti bakamoteebia, “Tiga abaiseke abekungi abanyabieni barigigwe barentwe asore, aye omorwoti.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.2.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.2.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 2:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aye omorwoti, chora abateneneri ase chingongo chionsi chi’obogambi bwao obachike basangererie abaiseke abekungi abare abanyabieni, baabarente ase enyomba y’abakungu ere agwo ase eburi ya Susa. Barabwo babekwe inse y’oborendi bwa Hegai, omokoreri oria ogombaetigwe, oyio otenenerete abakungu bamenyete ase enyomba yao. Abaiseke abwo baegwe amaguta abo bakweaka.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.2.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.2.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 2:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omoiseke oria orakogokie aye omorwoti, otige abe eting’ana ribaga ria Vasti.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.2.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.2.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ogosemia okwo gokagwenera omorwoti, ere agakora buna asemetigwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.2.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.2.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 2:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agwo ase eburi ya Susa, narengeo Omoyahudi oyomo ore korokwa Moredekai, mosinto o Yairi, o Simei, o Kisi, bw’ororeria rwa Benjamini.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.2.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.2.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 2:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Moredekai oyo nigo arenge oyomo bwa baria bairetwe ase obosomba chingaki chiria omorwoti Yekonia, omorwoti bw’Abayuda, abwo omorwoti Nebuchadnezzar airete ase obosomba amo nabaanto bande.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.2.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.2.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 2:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Moredekai natugete omoiseke oyomo, omwana o ise moke. Omoiseke oyio nigo arenge korokwa Hadasa, na erieta rinde n’Esiteri. Nigo abwate omobere omuya, naende nigo arenge omonyakieni mono. Ekero abaibori baye bonsi bakwete, Moredekai akaba okomotuga buna omwana oye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.2.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.2.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 2:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekero ogochika koria okoyia kw’omorwoti kwaraaretigwe, na abaiseke basangereretigwe agwo ase eburi ya Susa, bakabeekwa inse y’oborendi bwa Hegai, oyorenge omorendi bw’abakungu ase enyomba y’omorwoti; Esiteri nigo arenge oyomo bw’abwo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.2.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.2.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 2:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omoiseke oria akagokia Hegai mono, akanyora ogwancherwa nere. Ase obwango obwo Hegai akamoa amaguta akweaka erinde arorekane ore omonyakieni, na akamoa endagera yamogwenerete. Boigo akaa Esiteri abaiseke batano na babere abachoretwe asare korwa ase enyomba y’omorwoti bakaba bakomokorera. Hegai akaira Esiteri amo nabakoreri baria baye bamenye aase aagiya mono ase enyomba eria y’abakungu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.2.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.2.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 2:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bono Esiteri konya taremanyekania ekiagera konya Moredekai omosemirie, omokanirie ng’a tabaisa kwemanyekania ase abanto b’ense eria amenyete ng’a ngesaku ki are, gose noyo bw’enyomba ki.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.2.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.2.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 2:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kera rituko Moredekai nigo abeete okona‐gotaara ase eraaro, bosio bw’enyomba y’abakungu baria, erinde amanye buna Esiteri agendererete komenya agwo, na igoro y’obogima bwaye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.2.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.2.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 2:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kera oyomo ase abaiseke abwo nigo abeete okweroisia omobere oye ase engaki y’omwaka oyomo. Ase engaki y’emetienyi etano nomo emetang’ani nigo baare koba bakweaka amaguta a manemane, na emetienyi etano nomo ende babe bakweaka amaguta ande agotioka buya ase okweroisia emebere yabo. Erio ekero engaki yaigete; kera omoiseke oyomo oyomo akaba okorentwa ase omorwoti Ahaswero.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.2.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.2.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 2:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekero omoiseke arenge gochia ase obosio bw’omorwoti, nigo arenge koegwa korwa ase enyomba y’abaiseke baria egento kende gionsi arenge kogania koira.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.2.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.2.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 2:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nigo arenge kogenda ase omorwoti chingaki chia mogoroba, erio ase rituko rikobwatia ekero bwakire oirana gochia ase enyomba ende y’abakungu inse y’oborendi bwa Saasigasi, oyorenge omokoreri bw’abakungu ba sere‐sere b’omorwoti. Tarenge koirana gochia ase omorwoti eria kabere, otatiga onye omorwoti ogogetigwe nere, naende aba okomorangeria ase ogwatora erieta riaye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.2.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.2.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 2:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekero engaki y’okogenda ase omorwoti yaigete ase Esiteri, oyio orenge omoiseke bw’Abihaili, ise moke Moredekai, oyio omotugete buna omwana oye, taboretie gento kende akoirana otatiga ebi Hegai, omokorer bw’omorwoti, oria otenererete abaiseke baria, amosemetie. Bono Esiteri nigo agwenerete abanto bonsi baare komoorora.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.2.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.2.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 2:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase ayio, omwaka o gatano na kabere bw’okogamba kw’omorwoti Ahaswero, omotienyi o ikomi okorokwa Tebeti, Esiteri akarentwa ase omorwoti, agwo ase enyomba yaye y’oborwoti.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.2.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.2.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 2:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omorwoti akaba ogwancha Esiteri kobua abakungu bande bonsi. Esiteri akamogwenera akanyora obuya nogwancherwa ase omorwoti kobua abaiseke bande bonsi abekungi. Omorwoti akamobekeera egutwa y’oborwoti ase omotwe oye, akamobeka akaba eting’ana ribaga ria Vasti.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.2.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.2.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 2:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omorwoti agakora omoyega omonene bw’amasikani ase Esiteri, akarangeria abanene bonsi b’obogambi na abasomba baye aroro. Boigo akaraareria abanto bakeanerigwe ebango ase ense yaye, naende akarua ebiegwa ebinge buna omorwoti agwenerete akore.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.2.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.2.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Moredekai ogotooria obogima bw’omorwoti",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 2:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekero abaiseke abekungi basangererekanete engaki ya kabere, Moredekai akaba ogoikaransa ase egeita ki’omorwoti.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.2.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.2.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 2:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Esiteri konya taramanyia abanto b’ense eria ng’a ngesaku ki are, gose noyo bw’enyomba ki. Moredekai nigo amosemetie igo, na Esiteri akamoigwera buna konya abeire okomoigwera ekero akinetigwe nere.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.2.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.2.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 2:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase engaki eyio Moredekai arenge kobeera agwo ase egeita ki’enyomba y’oborwoti, abakoreri babere b’omorwoti, Bigitana, na Teresi, abwo barenge korenda ase egesieri ki’enyomba, bakaba nendamwamu ase omorwoti, bakarigia enchera y’okomoita.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.2.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.2.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 2:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Moredekai akamanya ayio, akayateebia Esiteri eting’ana, nere akayateebia omorwoti ribaga ria Moredekai.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.2.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.2.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 2:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Obotuki bogakorwa, na amang’ana akanyorekana ng’a namaene arenge; abanto baria babere bakabwatwa, bagatongwa ase chimbambo igoro. Amang’ana ayio akarikerwa ase obosio bw’omorwoti ase Egetabu ki’amang’ana arenge gokoreka.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.2.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.2.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
